# Language Rules

## Rule 4 (v030): English Language Requirement

All content appearing in the program you write must be in English. This includes:

- Code comments
- Variable names
- Method names
- Class names
- Documentation
- User-facing messages
- Error messages
- Log messages

This rule ensures consistency and makes the codebase accessible to an international development team.
